SUMMARY:La Milonguita Nota Negra
LOCATION:NOIR café\, Graefestraße 82\, Berlin
DESCRIPTION:Milonga: NOIRCAFÉ Saturday Dinner Menue \nStandard Menue\n----
 ------\nLa Milonguita Nota Negra \nThe darker the night\, the sweeter the 
 dance.\n\n- Entrée 2 € — donations welcome\nAperitif — 18:00–19:0
 0\n\nPRACTICA\nStarter\nA taste of tango walking\, seasoned with rhythm 
 — exploring which steps and styles pair best with each piece of music.\n
 \n- This week: Lucianita and Kojo\nA first sip of rhythm- a slow awakening
  for the senses\n\n- Main Course — 19:00–22:00\n\nLa Milonguita Nota N
 egra\nA rich blend of Argentine classics and hidden gems\, carefully seaso
 ned by DJ mojokojo\, delicately seasoned with a musical interlude by our s
 pecial guest \;)…\n\nBest enjoyed with dr\ninks\, served alongside with 
 tempting bites \;)…\n\nLean in. Let the night melt on your tongue\, each
  step a lingering bite of dark chocolate\, each glance a sip of red wine\,
  let your steps follow the flavor of the music. \n\nNOIRcafé\, Graefestra
 ße 82\n10967 Berlin\n----------\nQuelle: https://www.facebook.com/philip.
 kojo.96\n\nVeranstalter: Philip Kojo \n\nhttps://www.hoy-milonga.com/berli
 n/de/milonga/498559/La-Milonguita-Nota-Negra
