UID:504509@hoy-milonga-berlin
DTSTAMP:20261115T190000Z
DTSTART:20261115T190000Z
DTEND:20261116T000000Z
SUMMARY:After Party - Berlin Encuentro Milonguero
LOCATION:Ballhaus Rixdorf\, Kottbusser Damm 76\, Berlin
DESCRIPTION:Milonga: After-Party BERLIN ENCUENTRO MILONGUERO 2026\n--------
 --\nAn Open Invitation to the Entire Tango Community!\nAfter the magic of 
 the BERLIN ENCUENTRO MILONGUERO finish\, we warmly invite the entire tango
  community to come together for a very special evening of tango\, embraces
 \, and friendship.\n\nToday\, on Sunday\, November 15th\, 250 dancers from
  around the world will stay in Berlin for the BEM 2026\, taking place from
  November 13th to 15th.\n\nOur After-Party Milonga is open to everyone and
  is a wonderful opportunity for the local tango community and our internat
 ional guests to meet\, dance\, and share unforgettable tandas after the ev
 ent finish.\n\nWhile the BEM activities from Friday through Sunday afterno
 on are reserved for registered participants\, both the Pre-Party on Thursd
 ay night and the After-Party on Sunday night are open to all dancers.\n\nM
 usic by internationally renowned \n- DJ Gaston Godoy\, \noriginally from A
 rgentina and a beloved member of the Sevilla tango scene for many years.\n
 \n- Sunday\, November 15th\n- 8:00 PM - 1:00 AM\n\nRixdorf Ballhaus Berlin
 \nKottbusser Damm 76\, 10967 Berlin-Bezirk Neukölln\, Alemania\n\n- Entra
 nce: €15\n\nWe will open the doors for the milonga exactly at 8 PM and n
 ot before.\n\nCome and celebrate the international spirit of tango\, meet 
 dancers from every corner of the world\, and enjoy an evening filled with 
 music\, connection\, and warm embraces.\n\nWe will Celebrate also Guillerm
 o's Birthday sharing with all the dancer Italian Ice cream made in Berlin 
 for us !\n\nAnd if you're still thinking about joining the Berlin Encuentr
 o Milonguero\, you can find more information and registration details on o
 ur website:\n\nhttps://berlinencuentromilonguero.com\n\n- Don't forget: Su
 nday\, November 15th - a milonga for everyone!\n\nBring your friends\, you
 r tango shoes\, and your best embrace. We look forward to welcoming you to
  the dance floor at Rixdorf Ballhaus Berlin!\n----------\nQuelle/Source: h
 ttps://www.facebook.com/events/1735697491584768\n\nVeranstalter: Guillermo
  Monti\n\nhttps://www.hoy-milonga.com/berlin/de/milonga/504509/After-Party
 ---Berlin-Encuentro-Milonguero
URL:https://www.hoy-milonga.com/berlin/de/milonga/504509/After-Party---Berl
 in-Encuentro-Milonguero
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
