 ed level class where we switch roles and partners. You don't have to be fi
 t in both roles yet.\n\nSpecial edition: because of popular claim\, we hav
 e a second edition of Millennial Cortinas - get ready for some solid Green
  Day & Red Hot Chilly Peppers! For se Germans: Die Ärzte. For les Argenti
 nians: Babasonicos. Or perhaps die Toten Hosen with their mysterious fame 
